normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">첨부파일&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">“[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">안내문]</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학년도 신</span></span><b style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 19.9733px; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; background: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">·편입생 기초학력 증진 프로그램 안내문\"</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">을 꼭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">!&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>확인</b>해주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">※확인하지 않아 발생하는</span><b style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;불이익에 대해 책임지지 않으니</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">한번 더 안내문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">매뉴얼 등 확인 및 숙지 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">기초학력 증진 프로그램 인증여부 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">매주 금요일 확인 후 → 월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">화요일 중 인증여부 개별 안내 예정&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">금오톡톡</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><b style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">4. 인증혜택 및 미인증 유의사항</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- 인증혜택&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">BISKIT&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">마일리지 지급</span></span></p><div><b style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">- <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">미 인증시</span>: 다음학기 프로그램 자동연장, B 그룹의 경우 C그룹으로 조정되어 운영</span></b></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">5.</span></span><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">접속방법</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-학교홈페이지 원킷 로그인 →'기초학력 증진' 클릭</span></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><b>온라인 보완학습 이수시간은 4월 6일 (월) 증진 프로그램 시작 시점부터 인정</b></span>됩니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">6.&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>본인 점수 확인방법</b></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp;1) 학교 포털(Onekit) 접속 → 통합정보시스템 클릭&nbsp; → 학적 클릭&nbsp; → 학적부정보관리(학생) → 제일 뒷쪽 '기초학력평가' 탭 클릭&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;→ 점수 확인</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp;2) 학교홈페이지 원킷 로그인 →기초학력 증진' 클릭 → 진단평가 결과 확인</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp; ▶ 기초학력 증진 사이트 첫 접속 시 로그인 정보 확인을 위해 로딩시간(10초 이상)이 다소 소요됨을 양해 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">7. 2025학년도 최종 미인증자는 2026학년도 1학기 운영시 자동 연장되어 운영됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQZkh7A4gYwOYCEBWBBAXr5AKQGcBZAFwCcAVAUQGkAtAIwDpMAHVIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\">프로그램문의&nbsp; ☎054-478-7353</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\">시스템오류문의 ☎ 1670-2115</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
